      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VICTA GRAHAM (4) scored (30.01) last time out at this track adding to an already respectable career. Strike rate this course strong having won six of 11 tries. Has good box speed and can overcome the tricky draw. The hardest to beat again. BRAX KEEPING (1) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by a neck at Murray Bridge Straight in a handy 17.06 beating Chaotic Boy. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. TERRIFIC NERO (8) struggled for best form latest, finishing 5th (31.07) in a Special conditions race at Angle Park. Has won here at this journey. Speedy runner who can find the front with a clear break from out wide. Can measure up this time. VICTA WALLY (5) did the right thing for favourite backers last time - sure to feature again.",
